  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GRAISEA 2- Philippines (April to July 2023 Continuation of R08449)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Philippine country team will contribute to Result Area 3: National and Regional policy frameworks drive inclusive business practise that drive inclusivity, Women&apos;s Economic Empowerment (WEE) and climate resilience. The Gender Transformative and Responsible Agribusiness Investment in South East Asia (GRAISEA) PH team will continue to push and lobby at national and local level in creating an enabling environment for inclusive business, women&apos;s economic empowerment and climate resilience. Below are the major focus and targets of Year 5 influencing strategies with policy -makers and support stakeholders:   (1) Committee Deliberation of Poverty Reduction Through Social Entrepreneurship (PRESENT) Bill and Inclusive Business Bill (2)  Mobilizing Stakeholders of the PRESENT Coalition and broader stakeholders and Inclusive Business (IB) Champions and Allies from the Private Sector and its partners. (3) Piloting of Social Enterprise (SE) Localization  (4)  Promotion and showcasing of IB model and standards</narrative>
  </description>
